,"children":["Damage:"]}," 2d10 (Half Damage on Miss)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the being escapes the Thornbushes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," (DC 19):"]}," The character jumps over the Thornbushes, gaining a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 14):"]}," The character locates a part of the Thornbushes that is less densely packed with thorns, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Hazard."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," (DC 19):"]}," The character minimizes their contact with the thorns while moving through the bushes. As the character moves, their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by half and the character takes half damage from a successful attack by the Thornbushes (and no damage from a miss)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This Hazard can be avoided by cutting through the Thornbushes with an edged tool, a melee weapon, or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
